        <section id="threats-to-cyber-security"  class="t-bg-primary">
          
            <h2>Threats to cyber security</h2>
              <p>As we all know the technology landscape is constantly changing and this is even more relevant to cyber security especially with the disruption caused by the pandemic. None of us could envisage what would happen to this extent and what the impact would be on our lives and for business, technology and cyber security. This has created so many opportunities for cyber criminals to develop new attacks and threaten our cyber security.</p>

          
        </section>
        
    
     
    
  
  
