              <h3>Common Threats</h3>
<p>So as the threat landscape changes and new threats emerge, let's look at what we have to deal with today and what may come tomorrow in the field of cyber security.</p>

              <!-- sections.njk VIDEO! -->
              
              
              
      <div class="l-video-container">
        <video poster="~/images/svg/poster.svg" controls preload="metadata" aria-labelledby="watch" width="1000"
