              <h3>Effects on us all</h3>
<p>The Covid 19 pandemic has meant massive changes to the way we work. Let's have a look at some of the challenges that this has brought to cyber security.</p>

              <!-- sections.njk VIDEO! -->
              
              
              
      <div class="l-video-container">
        <video poster="~/images/svg/poster.svg" controls preload="metadata" aria-labelledby="watch" width="1000"
          data-base="cs_u4_s1_p2_effects_of_covid" 
          data-ext=".mp4" 
          data-multi="false"
          data-trans="cs_u4_s1_p2_effects_of_covid undefined">
          <source src="https://kpcontent.blob.core.windows.net/$web/resources/v2l/720/cs_u4_s1_p2_effects_of_covid.mp4" type="video/mp4">
          <track default label="English" kind="captions" srclang="en" src="~/videos/captions/vtt/cs_u4_s1_p2_effects_of_covid.vtt">
          <p>Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos</p>
        </video>
